        {
          "name": "英语写作中 \"-\"、\"–\" 和 \"—\" 的区别",
          "displayOrder": 0,
          "viewType": "list",
          "partOfSpeech": null,
          "entries": [
            {
              "word": "hyphen \"-\"",
              "pronunciation": null,
              "entryType": "word",
              "notes": null,
              "displayOrder": 0,
              "definitions": [
                {
                  "text": "最短的符号，它用来把两个词结合成一个词，比如merry-go-round（旋转木马）、off-shore（离岸），mac上直接按数字0右边的键，也就是hyphen键就可以打出来。",
                  "partOfSpeech": null,
                  "displayOrder": 0
                }
              ],
              "examples": [],
              "images": []
            },
            {
              "word": "en dash \"–\"",
              "pronunciation": null,
              "entryType": "word",
              "notes": null,
              "displayOrder": 1,
              "definitions": [
                {
                  "text": "表示 “之间” 的关系，比如parent–child interaction（父母与孩子间的互动）、 Monday–Friday（周一到周五），mac上同时按option+hyphen键打出来。",
                  "partOfSpeech": null,
                  "displayOrder": 0
                }
              ],
              "examples": [],
              "images": []
            },
            {
              "word": "em dash \"—\"",
              "pronunciation": null,
              "entryType": "word",
              "notes": null,
              "displayOrder": 2,
              "definitions": [
                {
                  "text": "最长的符号，它用途就多了，可以用来提供详细信息、表示转折、停顿等等，mac上同时按option+shift+hyphen键打出来。",
                  "partOfSpeech": null,
                  "displayOrder": 0
                }
              ],
              "examples": [],
              "images": []
            },
            {
              "word": "英语写作中 \"-\"、\"–\" 和 \"—\" 的区别",
              "pronunciation": null,
              "entryType": "word",
              "notes": "例子：teacher–parent conference (en dash) 指“教师和家长共同出席的会议”，而 teacher-parent conference (hyphen) 指“职业为教师的家长出席的会议”；infant–parent (en dash) 指“婴儿与父母之间”，而 infant-parent (hyphen) 指“还是婴儿的父母”。",
              "displayOrder": 3,
              "definitions": [],
              "examples": [],
              "images": []
            }
          ],
